  triage:title "AL.1/AL.3/AL.7 sprint-doc status frontmatter contradicts downstream usage and project-plan.md" ;
  triage:description "docs/plans/phase-al/sprint-AL1-runtime-contract.md and sprint-AL3-received-hook.md are status: in_progress, yet AL.8/AL.9 sprint docs cite their deliverables as done. AL.3 is tagged [COMPLETE] in project-plan.md while its own sprint-doc frontmatter says in_progress -- a direct cross-doc contradiction. AL.7 (sprint-AL7-peer-tls-m5-proof.md) is status: proposed and was never implemented (TLS quarantined per PR #774); this abandonment is disclosed in AL.9's prose but AL.7's own doc and project-plan.md were never updated to reflect it. Verify current frontmatter status field of each of the three sprint docs at ce43771271a0d05a746dff2411452f135d3574b6 and record exact line numbers." ;
